---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import benchmarking from '../../assets/images/ux-benchmarking.png';
import usertesting1 from '../../assets/images/usertesting-1.png';
import usertesting2 from '../../assets/images/usertesting-2.png';
import competitorAnalysis from '../../assets/images/competitor-analysis.png';
---
<Layout title="Research & Benchmarking | Andrew Smith" description="Usability testing, confidence studies, and quantitative benchmarking — measuring the experience over time to inform what gets prioritised.">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
  <div class="case-page">
    <SiteHeader />
    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="case-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow"><a class="breadcrumb-link" href="/portfolio/work">Work</a><span class="breadcrumb-separator">/</span><span>Research &amp; Benchmarking</span></p>
        <h1 class="display-title">Measuring the experience over time, not just at launch.</h1>
        <p class="hero-text">Research is how design converts assumption into evidence. The work below covers quantitative benchmarking, moderated usability testing, and competitor analysis — each serving a different question, all feeding back into what gets prioritised and why.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="meta-strip">
        <div class="meta-item"><p class="meta-label">Organisation</p><p class="meta-value">RAA</p></div>
        <div class="meta-item"><p class="meta-label">Role</p><p class="meta-value">Senior UX Design Lead</p></div>
        <div class="meta-item"><p class="meta-label">Tools</p><p class="meta-value">UserTesting.com, Optimal Workshop</p></div>
      </section>
      <section class="lead-image-section">
        <Image class="lead-image" src={benchmarking} alt="Usability benchmarking dashboard for RAA Insurance showing effectiveness, efficiency, satisfaction, and desirability metrics" decoding="async" widths={[720,1080,1440]} sizes="(max-width:78rem) 100vw, 78rem"/>
      </section>
      <section class="summary-section">
        <p class="section-kicker">UX Benchmarking</p>
        <h2>Tracking effectiveness, efficiency, and desirability across products over time.</h2>
        <div class="summary-main">
          <p>The benchmarking dashboard above measures the RAA Insurance quote experience against four dimensions: effectiveness (did users complete the task), efficiency (how long did it take), satisfaction (ease of use and usefulness), and desirability (word-choice responses to describe the experience). Running the same study at regular intervals shows whether the product is genuinely improving — or just changing.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="editorial-section">
        <div class="section-rail"><p class="section-kicker">Usability Testing</p></div>
        <div class="story-block">
          <p>Moderated sessions run through UserTesting.com give real-time insight into how members navigate RAA products. The session below shows a car insurance pay/renew test — pain points, friction moments, and moments of ease tagged in real time against the transcript. Every finding is tagged and classified before synthesis, so patterns emerge from data rather than memory.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="supporting-image-section">
        <Image class="supporting-image" src={usertesting1} alt="UserTesting session for RAA car insurance pay/renew — mobile screen recording with tagged transcript showing pain points, friction, and ease moments" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[720,1080,1440]} sizes="(max-width:78rem) 100vw, 78rem"/>
      </section>
      <section class="supporting-image-section">
        <Image class="supporting-image" src={usertesting2} alt="UserTesting confidence test for RAA Log Book app — mobile prototype session with friction and like tags across the transcript" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[720,1080,1440]} sizes="(max-width:78rem) 100vw, 78rem"/>
      </section>
      <section class="editorial-section">
        <div class="section-rail"><p class="section-kicker">Competitor Analysis</p></div>
        <div class="story-block">
          <p>Competitor analysis maps how other insurers handle the same problem — authenticated quote retrieval, pre-filled data, member recognition — and identifies where RAA's current state creates unnecessary friction. This kind of analysis informs the problem definition before any solutions are proposed.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="supporting-image-section">
        <Image class="supporting-image" src={competitorAnalysis} alt="Competitor analysis board showing AAMI, NRMA, Youi, and Suncorp authenticated quote and account flows with annotated observations" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[720,1080,1440]} sizes="(max-width:78rem) 100vw, 78rem"/>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
<style>
.case-page{position:relative;width:min(calc(100% - 3rem),78rem);margin:0 auto;padding:1.25rem 0 5rem}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-foreground);margin:0 0 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center}
.breadcrumb-link{font-weight:600}.breadcrumb-separator{color:var(--muted-foreground)}
h1,h2{margin:0;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.05em;color:var(--foreground)}
.display-title{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3.5rem);line-height:1.06;margin:1rem 0 0;max-width:28ch}
.hero-text,.story-block p,.summary-main p{font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 1rem}
.case-hero{padding:5rem 0 2rem}
.meta-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:2rem;padding:1.5rem 0 .5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.meta-label{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-foreground);margin:0}
.meta-value{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700}
.lead-image-section{padding:2rem 0 4rem}
.lead-image,.supporting-image{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:1.5rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-large)}
.supporting-image-section{padding:2rem 0 4rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.summary-section{padding:0 0 3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.summary-section h2{margin-top:.75rem;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.5vw,2.2rem);max-width:32ch}
.summary-main{margin-top:1.5rem;max-width:44rem}
.section-kicker{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-foreground);margin:0 0 .5rem}
.editorial-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:14rem minmax(0,1fr);gap:2rem;padding:3rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.story-block{max-width:44rem}
</style>
